and append-only-prefix checks passed. Ordinary `sha256sum --check` was run
after appending updated artifact hashes. Its actual entry counts and the
revision-aware verification of every historical mismatch are recorded in
the final task report. The old checksum lines remain unchanged; each old
hash for an edited artifact is checked against its producing Git revision.

